{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "942ee5ceb72e9c66",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/07-計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_map.png",
			"x": -260,
			"y": -300,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 230
		},
		{
			"id": "b78d7284d668a76a",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/10-計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_map.png",
			"x": -260,
			"y": 80,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 216
		},
		{
			"id": "e574d65bd958cca3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 今天要找 cache 內容，36 要找但是就會發現在 cache 的 index 和 tag 會導致找到 5 號，但是實際是要找 9 號 block，所以出現了錯。\n\n- 位址 36 對應：\n\t\n\t- $B = ⌊36/4⌋ = 9$，$O = 0$\n\t    \n\t- $I = 9 \\mod 4 = 1$ → 查快取格 1\n\t    \n\t- 需要的 **$tag = ⌊9/4⌋ = 2$**\n\n這是**衝突未命中**（direct-mapped 同 index 衝突）。",
			"x": 220,
			"y": 80,
			"width": 558,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "f11c30d2d6f76a74",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/13-更新 cache 的內容.png",
			"x": -260,
			"y": 400,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 204
		},
		{
			"id": "600fac2b494967aa",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 更新 cache 的內容",
			"x": 252,
			"y": 470,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "454363474c3a76f7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "是。由 **cache controller** 負責在 miss 時更新該格：\n\n流程（direct-mapped 範例）\n\n1. CPU 給位址 → 解析出 **index、tag、offset**。\n    \n2. 用 index 找到快取格，檢查 **valid** 與 **tag 比對**。\n    \n3. 若不符（miss）→ 控制器向下層取 **整個 block**：\n    \n    - 如該格 **dirty=1** 先寫回舊 block。\n        \n    - 將新 block 放入此格，**寫入新 tag**、設 **valid=1**、重設 **dirty**。\n        \n4. 用 offset 取出目標位元組回給 CPU。\n    \n5. 若是寫入，依策略更新（write-through 或 write-back 並設 dirty）。",
			"x": -320,
			"y": -720,
			"width": 530,
			"height": 339,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "01a46d0af23f079d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/15-更新 cache 的內容.png",
			"x": -260,
			"y": 740,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 224
		},
		{
			"id": "fa7259daa4bac412",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/02-命中範例圖案中那個是比較器.png",
			"x": -1080,
			"y": -802,
			"width": 480,
			"height": 272
		},
		{
			"id": "12044ecebfb60728",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/05-失敗範例.png",
			"x": -1080,
			"y": -420,
			"width": 445,
			"height": 255
		},
		{
			"id": "21a1c27b11d4160d",
