			"width": 484,
			"height": 280
		},
		{
			"id": "b982cbb7cb74408e",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/14-計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_map.png",
			"x": -1080,
			"y": 620,
			"width": 489,
			"height": 281
		},
		{
			"id": "bb5d87a9f16d402e",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/16-計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_map.png",
			"x": -1094,
			"y": 1000,
			"width": 518,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "c8ba2c6b9f08a058",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "命中範例圖案中那個是比較器",
			"x": -1480,
			"y": -710,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "806e783d71508348",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "失敗範例",
			"x": -1475,
			"y": -316,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 50,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "0a1be920f1e21fba",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/03-Cache 要幾個 block 了.png",
			"x": 1040,
			"y": -680,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 223
		},
		{
			"id": "b46ddc189b317ade",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Cache 要幾個 block 了",
			"x": 1537,
			"y": -605,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "71e5921fe57e2956",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/06-計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_map.png",
			"x": 1040,
			"y": -380,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 190
		},
		{
			"id": "a19cf52be5f35f88",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- **Offset 位數 = log₂(block size)**。  \n    32 B/line ⇒ offset = **log₂32 = 5 bits**（選 line 內第幾個 byte）。\n    \n- **Index 位數 = log₂(cache size / block size)**。  \n    16 KB / 32 B = 512 lines = 2⁹ ⇒ index = **9 bits**。\n    \n- **Tag 位數 = 位址總長度 − index − offset**。  \n    若實體位址 32 bits ⇒ tag = 32 − 9 − 5 = **18 bits**（與圖一致）。\n    \n\n說明：offset 只由「每行大小」決定，用來在該行內定位到某個 byte；tag 是剩餘高位元，用來和該 index 的快取格比對。",
			"x": 1560,
			"y": -380,
			"width": 540,
			"height": 249,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "53604628dab0a266",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/08-對。 Index 與可快取位址空間無關。.png",
			"x": 3300,
			"y": -162,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 158
		},
		{
			"id": "577339e0d85d53da",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/04-先算 一行的資料大小.png",
			"x": 3300,
			"y": -658,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 201
		},
		{
			"id": "f7f2b18ba8dd2d2f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/11-對。 Index 與可快取位址空間無關。.png",
			"x": 3300,
			"y": 156,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 177
		},
		{
			"id": "d9b159dfe88c4f60",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "1. 先算**一行的資料大小**\n   = **block size（位元組）**。如果題目給「4 words/line、1 word = 4 B」，那就是 16 B/line。\n\n2. 算**行數**\n   = **cache data 容量（位元組） ÷ block size（位元組）**。\n   只除「整個 block 大小」，不是只除 words 數。\n\n3. **Index 位數**\n   = **log₂(行數)**。\n\n4. **Offset 位數**\n   = **log₂(block size in bytes)**。\n   若要拆成「word 選擇 + byte 選擇」，再把這個數拆開即可。\n\n5. **Tag 位數**\n   = **位址總長度 − index − offset**。\n\n6. **含開銷的快取總位元數**\n   = **行數 × [ block 資料位元數 + tag 位數 + valid(1) + dirty(有就加1) ]**。\n   note: **block 資料位元數 = block size × 8**，不是取 log₂。\n",
			"x": 2393,
			"y": -762,
			"width": 667,
			"height": 442,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "053b8e201cd76cdd",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "對。**Index 與可快取位址空間無關。**\n\n* 直接對映：`index = log2(快取行數) = log2(cache_size / block_size)`\n* 組相連 E-way：`index = log2(集合數) = log2(cache_size / (block_size × E))`\n\n改變「可快取位址空間」只會改 **tag**：`tag = 位址長度 − index − offset`。\n`offset = log2(block_size)`。\n",
			"x": 2393,
			"y": -193,
			"width": 652,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "4bd1273669a16055",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_mapped_cache/01-計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Direct_map.png",
			"x": 2393,
			"y": -1320,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 232
		},
		{
			"id": "d82860b0064096fd",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- block 變大 → 利用**空間局部性**，**強制性 miss**下降，所以 miss rate 先降。\n    \n- 太大 → 同容量下可容納的**行數變少**，**容量與衝突 miss**上升，miss rate又回升。\n    \n- 快取越大（右側 16K/64K/256K 線），整體 miss rate 越低且對 block 大小不那麼敏感。\n    ",
			"x": 2923,
			"y": -1480,
			"width": 677,
			"height": 94,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "73f1883cc500acb8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "1. **Block 變大 → miss penalty 變貴**  \n    miss penalty = 取回整個區塊所需時間  \n    = **首字延遲（latency to first word）** + **其餘字傳輸時間（transfer time）**。  \n    區塊越大，第二項越長。\n    \n2. **降低 miss penalty 的兩招**\n    \n    - **Early restart**：先拿到要的字就讓 CPU 繼續執行，其餘字背景搬。\n        \n    - **Critical-word first**：傳輸順序改為先送被請求的字，再送同一區塊其他字。  \n        兩者都不減少 miss 次數，只縮短一次 miss 的停頓時間。\n        \n3. **大區塊的取捨**\n    \n    - 好處：利用**空間局部性**，**強制性 miss**下降。\n        \n    - 壞處：\n        \n        1. 區塊越大 → 行數變少 → **容量/衝突 miss**上升。\n            \n        2. 區塊太大 → 同一區塊內的實際空間局部性變弱 → 下載許多用不到的字。\n            \n        3. 區塊越大 → **miss penalty**更久。  \n            所以 miss rate 會**先降後升**，存在最佳區塊大小。",
			"x": 2923,
			"y": -1320,
			"width": 698,
			"height": 418,
			"color": "5"
		}
	],
